{{TWExclusive}}
'''HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Collaboration Event]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = HAPPI & Maji Cat & Cat
|image = E 466.png
|appearance = [[Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 500元 - 1,975元
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy is similar to [[Merc & Cat]], but weaker attacks in exhange for more HP. It's omni shouldn't do much other than hitting Basic Cat and counterparts.

==Strategy==
Anything that deals damage should work along with meatshields. Bringing along cats with rebound attack like [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev Cat]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] will take this enemy down much faster.

